            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Okhakhola sifwaabi ne sengeo namwe wandaaye owa maao tawe. Sikila abo bali balebe bowo. Mwembi aba mwakholile luuswa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omundu nakhola sifwaabi ne mukha khochaawe namwe mukha raraawe wandaaye owa raraawe. Bombi balasuta luuswa lwabwe mala bafwe bukuumba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.18.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bal. 18.16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Omundu ne akona nende mukha wandaaye, sili sifwaabi. Aba aambisie wandaaye chisoni. Bombi balafwa bukuumba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Khwako, liinda kamalaka kase koosi, nio sibala nisio ndikho muyilamo siikhamuloba tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukhakhola kimiima kie babaandu nibo ndikho ndusia ebweeni wenywe tawe. Sikila bakhola kamabi kano koosi, mala nabaleka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kakhali ese namusuubiisie ndi, ‘Mukhabukule sibala siabwe, ne khamuelesie enywe sibala nisio kamabeele ne bubuukhi biseleetekhanga, sibe sisienywe. Ese ndi Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wenywe, owamwaula khukhwama khu kholo chichiindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khwako mukhoya mukabukhasie chisaang'i ne chinyuni nicho balia nende nicho bakhalia tawe. Mukhalia chisaang'i ne chinyuni chinyaalu namwe sisiindu siosi simoola tawe. Naboolile ndi chili chinyaalu ne khuchilia lilamukhola enywe khuba bakhali batakaase tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukhoya mwaba batakatifu khwise sikila ese Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi ndi Omutakatifu. Namwabukhasie enywe khukhwama khukholo chichiindi nio mube babaandu base.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
